# Sample MCP Tool Call Request

File: ooda/mcp/examples/tool_call_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "ooda.northstar",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
```

## Expected Response (abbreviated)

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "result": {
    "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "openOODA is a systems programming language..."}]
  }
}
```
